# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) for local worldgen / Vite dev.
# The worldgen explorer reads these at dev-server start.
#
# Option A — environment variable (either name works).
# Restart npm run dev:worldgen after editing. The explorer shows "Key is set" but never displays the value.
VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Option B — secrets file (see `.secrets/anthropic-api-key.example`)
# Leave the vars above empty and put the key in:
#   .secrets/anthropic-api-key
